      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "To get the smallest possible average, we want to use the smallest \\(4\\) positive even integers.\n\nThis can be achieved as follows: \\[ \\dfrac{2 + 4 + 6 + 8}{4} = \\dfrac{20}{4}\\]\\[ = 5. \\]\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
